<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-AUSTRALIAN P-NOTES - Tenders total A$45 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-AUSTRALIAN P-NOTES - Tenders total A$45 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two issuers came to the Australian commercial paper market on Monday to raise a total of A$45 million via tenders.</p>
<p>Building products and energy group Boral Ltd made the larger issue, selling A$30 million of its early January-dated paper at about four basis points over the mid-rate for the nearest corresponding bank bill.</p>
